From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:36:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] MLD STA: disable_eht leaves a network no usable MLD link

mac80211 refuses an MLD association with ASSOC_REQ_DISABLE_EHT, so a
network with disable_eht set associates to one link of an AP MLD as a
non-MLD HE station.

Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>

--- a/wpa_supplicant/bss.c
+++ b/wpa_supplicant/bss.c
@@ -1962,6 +1962,9 @@
 	if (!bss->valid_links)
 		return 0;
 
+	if (ssid && ssid->disable_eht)
+		return 0;
+
 	os_get_reltime(&now);
 
 	rsne_type = -1;
